+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm for the authentication system. The decision was recorded on 2026-09-25 (claude-mem observation #5) on the grounds that argon2id is memory-hard and resists GPU-accelerated brute-force and timing side-channel attacks. No tuning parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism, salt or output length) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
